{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 373, "line_no": 6, "text": "取得的阶段性成就。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 507, "w": 346, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "取得的阶段性成就。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 507, "w": 346, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 373, "line_no": 7, "text": "此外，布依族作家们还在文学和文化研究领域不断开拓，多年来有若干论文及专著", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 567, "w": 1463, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "此外，布依族作家们还在文学和文化研究领域不断开拓，多年来有若干论文及专著", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 567, "w": 1463, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
